('Nq4wPuQ','Bd6','1. Bd6+ $1 {White has no choose.} R5xd6 2. Rxd6 Rxg8 3. Qg7 $1 {Or resign...} Qc5 $1 {Else an immediate stalemate} (Qxg7 $144 4. Rd8+ Rxd8 $11 {stalemate}) (Qxd6 $144 4. Qxb7+ Kxb7 $11 {stalemate}) 4. Rc6 $3 {A nice extension to the previous move.} (4. Rd7 $143 Bf7 $1 $19 5. Rc7 Qb4 6. Rxb7+ Kxb7 7. Qxf7+ Ka6 8. Qb7+ Ka5 9. Qa7+ (9. Qd5+ $144 Qb5 10. Qd2+ Ka6 $19) Kb5 10. Qd7+ Kc4 11. Qd4+ Kb3 12. Qd5+ Qc4 $19) (4. Rd5 $143 Qxb6 $19) Qf5 (Qxb6 $144 5. Qe5+ $11) (a2 $144 5. Rxc5 Rxg7 6. Rc8+ $11) 5. Rf6 $1 {Guarding f1} (5. Qc7+ $143 Ka8 $19) Qc8 6. Rc6 $1 {The rook''s exhibition continues} (6. Rf8 $143 Rxf8 7. Qe5+ Ka8 8. Qa5+ Ba6 $19) (6. Qc7+ $143 Qxc7 7. bxc7+ Kc8 $19) a2 $1 {A last try to win. The move Ba6 recommended by computers give two ways to draw} (Qd8 $144 7. Qe5+ Ka8 8. Rc8+ Qxc8 9. Qb8+ $11) (Ba6 $144 {computers} 7. Rxc8+ (7. Rc7 $144 a2 8. Rxb7+ $11) Rxc8 8. Qg3+ Ka8 9. Qg8 Kb8 10. Qg3+ Ka8 11. Qg8 Rb8 12. Qb3 Rf8 13. Qg8 $11) 7. Rxc4 $1 {Accurately to the whole finish.} (7. Rxc8+ $143 Rxc8 8. Qe5+ Ka8 9. Qa5+ (9. Qc3 $144 Rd8 $1 $19) Ba6 10. Qa3 Rd8 $1 11. Kg1 (11. Qc1 $144 Rf8 $19) (11. Qa4 $144 Rf8 $19) Rd1+ 12. Kf2 Rf1+ 13. Kg3 a1=Q $19) (7. Qe5+ $143 Ka8 8. Qa5+ Ba6 9. Qxa2 Rg1+ 10. Kxg1 Qg4+ 11. Kf2 Qh4+ 12. Kg1 Qe1#) Qxc4 8. Qxb7+ {but not a careless} (8. Qxg8+ $143 Qc8 $19 9. Qg1 Qf8 10. Qg3+ Ka8 11. Qxh3 a1=Q+ $19) Kxb7 $11 {stalemate}'),
('6iFv6Rf','Ne5','1. Ne5+ Kb6 $1 2. Nd7+ Kxa6 3. Nf3 $1 (3. Nc5+ $143 Kb6 4. Nd7+ Kc6 5. Ne5+ Kd5 $19) Rd1 $1 4. Nd4 $1 (4. Nfe5 $143 Bc6 5. Nxc6 Rxh1 $19) Bc6 $1 (Bxh1 $144 5. Nc5+ Kb6 6. Nd7+ $11) 5. Rxd1 (5. Ne6 $143 Bxd7 6. Rxd1 exd1=R $1 $19) exd1=Q (exd1=R $144 6. Nxc6 Ne8 7. Nce5 Ng7 8. Nc5+ Kb6 9. Ncd7+ $11) 6. Ne6 Bxd7 7. Nc7+ Kb6 8. Nd5+ Kc6 9. Ne7+ Kb6 10. Nd5+ Qxd5 $11 {stalemate}'),
