('tgOb1fJ','Kh6','1. Kh6 $1 (1. Kxh5 $143 Rh8+ 2. Kg4 Kf8 $11) Rh8+ (Kd7 $144 2. Rh7 Ke6 3. Kg7 Rd8 4. Rh6+ f6 5. exf6 exf6 6. Rxf6+ Ke7 7. Rf7+ Kd6 8. f5 $18) 2. Rh7 Rg8 3. Rh8 $1 (3. f5 $143 Rg1 4. Rh8+ Kd7 5. Rf8 Re1 6. Kxh5 Rxe5 7. Rxf7 Ke8 8. Kg6 Re1 $11) Rxh8+ 4. Kg7 Rf8 5. f5 e6 (f6 $144 6. e6 $18) 6. f6 Rh8 7. Kxh8 Kf8 8. Kh7 $18 {Nice R-study with a beautiful R-sacrifice and a Reti study motifs, the only difference is that the author replaced the Queen by a Rook in the finale (HHdb-III, 55651. Reti 1928. No19 Reti-1).}'),
