('mhFxrd3','Qc1','1. Qc1+ $1 (1. Qxa2 $143 c1=Q 2. Nxd3 Qc7+ 3. Kh3 Qd7+ 4. Kh2 Qd6+ $11) Bd1 (Kxf2 $144 2. Nh3+ Ke2 3. Nf4+ Kf2 4. Qg1#) 2. Nxd1 (2. Nxd3 $143 Qa7 ({but} Qxb3 $144 3. Nf4 Qb1 $11 {draws too, or not?}) 3. Nh3 Qg1+ 4. Nxg1 $11 {stalemate 1.}) Rxd2+ 3. Nf2+ (3. Qxd2 $143 cxd1=Q 4. Qxa2 Qd2+ ({but} Qh5+ $144 5. Kg3 Qe5+ $11 {perpetual check.}) 5. Qxd2 $11 {stalemate 2.}) Rd1 4. Nd3 (4. Qg5 $143 c1=Q 5. Qg2+ Ke1 6. Nf3+ Ke2 7. Nxd1+ Kxd1 8. Qxa2 Qb2+ $1 9. Qxb2 $11 {stalemate 3.}) Rxc1 5. Ne2 $3 Kxe2 (Qxb3 $144 6. Ng3#) 6. Nxc1+ Kd2 7. Nxa2 $18'),
('WMbcIKZ','Ne7','1. Ne7 $1 (1. e7 $143 Nd5 2. Kb7 Bf7 $19) d1=Q $1 (Nd5 $144 2. Nxd5 d1=Q 3. Nf6+ $1 Kxg7 4. c8=Q Qh1+ 5. Ka7 Be3+ 6. Ka6 Qf1+ 7. c4 {mat hucumu ile, meselen} Bxf4 8. Qxg8+ Kxf6 9. Qf7+ Kg5 10. Qf5+ Kh6 11. Qf6+ Kh7 12. Bf5+ Kg8 13. Qf7+ Kh8 14. Qh7#) 2. Bxd1 (2. c8=Q $143 Qh1+ 3. Ka7 Be3+ 4. Kb8 Bxf4+ 5. Ka7 Be3+ $11) Nd5 $1 3. Nxd5 (3. c8=Q $143 Nb6+ 4. Kb7 Nxc8 5. Nxc8 g2 $19) Bxe6 4. g8=Q+ $1 {qara shahi 8-ci ufuqi xette aparmaq lazimdir} (4. Bg4 $143 Bxd5+ 5. Ka7 g2 6. c8=Q g1=Q+ 7. Ka6 Bc4+ 8. Qxc4 Qxg4 $11) (4. Bf3 $143 Kxg7 5. Kb7 a3 6. Nb4 Bxf4 7. c8=Q Bxc8+ 8. Kxc8 Kf6 9. Kd7 Ke5 10. Na2 Kd4 $11) Kxg8 5. Bg4 $3 (5. f5 $143 Bxd5+ 6. Ka7 Be3+ 7. Ka6 Bc4+ 8. Ka5 Bd2+ 9. c3 Bxc3+ 10. Kb6 Bd4+ 11. Kb7 Bd5+ 12. Ka6 Bc4+ 13. Ka5 Bc3+ $11) (5. Nf6+ $143 Kh8 $1 6. Bg4 Bxf4 7. Bxe6 Bxc7 8. Bd5 a3 $19) Bxd5+ (Bxg4 $144 6. Nf6+ Kg7 7. Nxg4 g2 8. c8=Q g1=Q 9. Qd7+ Kf8 10. Qd8+ Kf7 11. Ne5+ Kg7 12. Qd7+ $1 Kh8 13. Nf7+ $1 Kg8 (Kg7 $144 14. Ng5+ $18 {#2}) 14. Qd5 $1 Qg7 (Kg7 $144 15. Ng5 Bxf4 16. Qf7+ Kh6 17. Qh7+ Kxg5 18. Qg7+ $18) 15. Ne5+ Kh7 16. Qh1+ Qh6 17. Qxc1 $18) 6. Ka7 $1 (6. Kb8 $143 Bxf4 $19) Be3+ 7. Ka6 Bc4+ 8. Ka5 Bd2+ 9. c3 $1 {a1-h8 diaqonalina filin Roma celbetmesi} (9. Kxa4 $143 Ba6 $19) Bxc3+ 10. Kb6 Bd4+ 11. Kb7 Bd5+ 12. Kb8 $1 {indi e5 xanasi elchatmazdir} g2 $1 13. c8=Q+ Kg7 $1 14. Qd7+ $1 (14. Qc7+ $143 Bf7 $11) Kf6 15. Be6 $3 ({loss of time} 15. Qd8+ $144 Kg7 16. Qg5+ Kf8 $1 17. Qh6+ Ke7 $1 18. Qh7+ Kf8 19. Qf5+ Kg7 20. Qd7+ Kf6 $18) g1=Q (Bxe6 $144 16. Qxd4+ $18) (Ba7+ $144 16. Qxa7 $18) 16. Qf7# {Qara filler ile ag shahin sistematik hereketi ve Roma celbetmesi chox maraqlidir. Ancaq girisde choxlu sayda fiqurlarin vurulmasi ve coxsayli tehliller teessurati ashagi salir. Final mati da celbedici deyil. Black Bishops'' and wK''s systematic movement plus Roman enticement are very interesting. The fact that there are many captures and not less analysis in the introductory play reduces the impression. Also the final mate is not nice.}