('weM2ESt','h7','1. h7 (1. Nf8+ $144 $1 {dual} Kc6 2. h7 Bb2 3. Rc2+ Kd5 4. Rxb2 Rg1+ 5. Ng6 Rxg6+ 6. Kh8 a1=R $11 {Tour folle}) (1. Nc5+ $143 dxc5 2. h7 Rb1 3. Rxa2 Rb8+ 4. Kf7 Be3 5. Kg6 Rb6+ 6. Kf7 Bd4 7. Rh2 Rb8 8. Rh5 (8. Rg2 $144 Rh8 9. Kg6 Kd6 $19) Kd6 9. Rh6+ Kd5 10. Rh5+ Be5 11. Kg6 Rh8 $19) Bb2 2. Nc5+ $1 (2. Nf8+ $144 $1 {dual} Kc6 3. Rxb2 Rg1+ 4. Ng6 Rxg6+ 5. Kh8 a1=R $11 {Tour b2 folle}) (2. Rxb2 $143 Rg1+ 3. Kf7 Rf1+ 4. Kg6 Rf6+ $1 5. Kxf6 a1=Q 6. Kf7 Qxb2 7. Nf8+ Kd8 8. Ng6 d5 9. Ke6 (9. h8=Q+ $144 Qxh8 10. Nxh8 $19) Ke8 $1 10. h8=Q+ (10. Kxd5 $144 Qg2+ 11. Kd4 Qg4+ 12. Kc3 Qh3+ 13. Kd4 Qxh7 $19) Qxh8 11. Nxh8 $19 d4 $19) dxc5 (Kc6 $144 3. Rxb2 Rg1+ 4. Kf7 $1 Rf1+ 5. Kg6 Rf6+ 6. Kxf6 a1=Q 7. Nd3 $1 $11) 3. Rxb2 Rg1+ 4. Kh8 $1 Rg2 $1 (a1=R $144 5. Rd2+ $11 {Desesperado Tower}) (a1=Q $144 $11 {stalemate}) 5. Rb1 $1 Rg8+ (Rh2 $144 6. Ra1 Rg2 7. Rd1+ {Desesperado Tower}) (axb1=Q $144 $11 {Stalemate}) (a1=Q+ $144 6. Rxa1 $11 {Desesperado Tower}) (c4 $144 6. Rd1+ Kc6 7. Rd6+ $11 {Desesperado Tower}) 6. hxg8=Q (6. Kxg8 $143 axb1=Q $19) axb1=Q {Now six men} 7. Qg4+ Kd8 8. Qg8+ Kd7 9. Qg4+ Kd6 10. Qg6+ Qxg6 $11 {stalemate}'),
('Rn3gdAe','hxg8=N','{Gewinn} 1. hxg8=N d5 2. Bf3 d4+ 3. Kb4 $1 d3 4. Nh6 gxh6 5. g7 h5 6. g8=N h4 7. Nf6 exf6 8. e7 f5 9. e8=N f4 10. Nd6 cxd6 11. c7 d5 12. c8=N d4 13. Nb6 axb6 14. a7 b5 15. a8=B (15. a8=Q $143 bxc4 16. Qf8 c3 17. Qxf4 c2 18. Qxh4 c1=Q 19. Rxc1 $11) bxc4 16. Bae4 c3 17. Bxd3 c2 18. Bf1 d3 19. Kb3 (19. Kb5 $144 c1=R 20. Rxc1 Bf2 21. B1xg2#) (19. Kc4 $144 c1=R+ 20. Rxc1 Bf2 21. B1xg2#) (19. Ka4 $144 c1=R 20. Rxc1 Bc5 21. B1xg2#) c1=Q 20. Rxc1 Bd4 21. B1xg2#'),
('ooHQxk7','b6','1. b6 Be5 (Re7+ $144 2. Kf1 Be5 3. Rc8 Kg7 4. b7 Rxc7 5. b8=Q Rc1+ 6. Rxc1 Bxb8 7. Kg1 $18) 2. Bxe5 Re7 {pin} 3. f4 $1 (3. Rb7 $143 Rxb7 4. Bc7 f5 $1 {Diagramme #} 5. Kd2 f4 6. Kd3 Kg6 7. Ke4 g3 8. fxg3 fxg3 9. Bxg3 Rxb6 $19) gxf3 (fxe5 4. b7 exf4+ 5. Kd2 $18) (g3 4. b7 gxh2 5. Rh8+ Kxh8 6. b8=Q+ Kg7 7. Qa8 $18) 4. Rb7 $1 Rxb7 5. Bc7 Kg6 6. Kf2 Kg5 7. Kg3 $1 (7. Kxf3 $143 Kf5 8. Ke3 Ke6 9. Ke4 Rxc7 (f5+ $143 10. Kf4 Kf6 11. Kg3 Kg6 12. Kxh3 $18) 10. bxc7 Kd7 $11) (7. Ke3 $143 Kg4 8. Kf2 a4 9. bxa4 a5 10. Ke3 f5 11. Kf2 f4 12. b3 Kg5 13. Kxf3 Kf5 14. Kf2 Ke4 15. b4 axb4 16. a5 b3 17. a6 b2 18. axb7 b1=Q 19. b8=Q $11) Kf5 (Kg6 $144 8. Kxh3 $18) 8. Kxf3 $18 {zz. . The composer indicated that 4.Rb7 is both a pinning and an unpinning move, which is not correct. Nice study, the B/R-combination is partly anticipated. HvH}'),
('2OYdVeh','Bd5','1. Bd5+ $1 (1. g7 $143 Rxb3+ 2. Ka6 Rb7 3. g8=Q Rb6+ $11) exd5 2. g7 Rb3+ 3. Ka6 d4 $1 4. e6 $1 (4. g8=B $143 Bxe5 5. Bxb3 Bf6 6. Bd5+ Kb8 7. Bxf3 Bh4 8. Kb6 Bd8+ 9. Kc5 Bxa5 $11) Rb2 5. e7 Rb7 $1 (Rb1 $144 6. g8=B $18 {#}) 6. g8=N $1 (6. e8=B $143 Ra7+ 7. Kb6 Rb7+ $11) (6. e8=N $143 Rxg7 7. Nxg7 Bg3 $11 {eg :} 8. Nf5 Bxf2 9. Nxh6 Bg3 10. Ng4 f2 11. Nxf2 Bxf2 12. Kb6 Be3 13. Kb5 Kb7 14. a6+ Ka7 15. Kc5 Kxa6 16. h6 Bxh6 17. Kxd4 $11) Rb1 (Ra7+ $144 7. Kb6 Rb7+ 8. Kc5 Rc7+ 9. Kxd4 Rc8 10. Nf6 Ba7+ 11. Ke4 Bxf2 12. e8=Q Rxe8+ 13. Nxe8 Be1 14. Kxf3 $18) 7. Nf6 $1 Re1 8. e8=Q Rxe8 9. Nxe8 Bg3 10. Kb6 Bxf2 11. Nc7+ Kb8 12. a6 $18 {#7}'),
